{"4238610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hourfall", "steam_appid": 4238610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note that this is not a full game, but rather a small slice intended to showcase how Hourfall could look and play. This demo was created by a team of students over the course of a semester. Despite our passion for the project, you may encounter graphical glitches or technical issues, and the quality may not match that of a fully produced game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/extras/2c866d5463bb8a4991b47021c3e9b26e.avif?t=1773670860\" width=1280 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hourfall</i> is a character-action RPG where you step into the role of the Clock Hand, the executioner of Time itself.<br>After developing sentience, you were deemed a flaw - discarded and cast from the Clock Tower by your former master. Weakened, but no longer bound, you begin your ascent with a single, clear goal: to reach the top of Time's tower and confront your former master at its peak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through Time’s servants using your three Clock Hand blades, master fast-paced combat, and make every second count - <strong>before your own time runs out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/extras/abf2e3d51356c7e1c42821824d68c81a.avif?t=1773670860\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time is Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a timer, which begins to tick when you enter combat. Should it run out, you die. Damage taken will not reduce your HP, but instead take seconds off your timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/extras/4ac0f5ec85d8924399227427fe1d94b8.avif?t=1773670860\" width=381 height=369 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Clockhand Blades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the three different clock hands as weapons, each with their own unique abilitie. Depending on what weapon you use to kill, you generate a different ressource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/extras/46badea3c106d6494ac6c1d53401a959.avif?t=1773670860\" width=400 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who are you going to be?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now freed from your duties and your past life, it is time to forge a new identity and choose who you will become. Will you wield your executioner’s skills for the greater good, or will you abandon your old role entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/extras/a2f3c998c5a91365ec898626180ade84.avif?t=1773670860\" width=400 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note that this is not a full game, but rather a small slice intended to showcase how Hourfall could look and play. This demo was created by a team of students over the course of a semester. Despite our passion for the project, you may encounter graphical glitches or technical issues, and the quality may not match that of a fully produced game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/extras/2c866d5463bb8a4991b47021c3e9b26e.avif?t=1773670860\" width=1280 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hourfall</i> is a character-action RPG where you step into the role of the Clock Hand, the executioner of Time itself.<br>After developing sentience, you were deemed a flaw - discarded and cast from the Clock Tower by your former master. Weakened, but no longer bound, you begin your ascent with a single, clear goal: to reach the top of Time's tower and confront your former master at its peak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through Time’s servants using your three Clock Hand blades, master fast-paced combat, and make every second count - <strong>before your own time runs out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/extras/abf2e3d51356c7e1c42821824d68c81a.avif?t=1773670860\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time is Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a timer, which begins to tick when you enter combat. Should it run out, you die. Damage taken will not reduce your HP, but instead take seconds off your timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/extras/4ac0f5ec85d8924399227427fe1d94b8.avif?t=1773670860\" width=381 height=369 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Clockhand Blades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the three different clock hands as weapons, each with their own unique abilitie. Depending on what weapon you use to kill, you generate a different ressource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/extras/46badea3c106d6494ac6c1d53401a959.avif?t=1773670860\" width=400 height=139 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who are you going to be?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now freed from your duties and your past life, it is time to forge a new identity and choose who you will become. Will you wield your executioner’s skills for the greater good, or will you abandon your old role entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/extras/a2f3c998c5a91365ec898626180ade84.avif?t=1773670860\" width=400 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Hourfall is a fast-paced character-action RPG where you wield three unique clock hand blades, fight fantastic servants of Time, and race against a ticking timer while in combat.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/9394a079e54b1aa96a14beb1cab639881c9318e5/header.jpg?t=1773670860", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/4ba716175c3c9324c277de779236b3b652b0676b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773670860", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238610/4ba716175c3c9324c277de779236b3b652b0676b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773670860", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 Ti / AMD RX 470 (4GB VRAM or more)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 16:9 HIGHLY RECOMMENDED</li